<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 3.0055.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 3.0055.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0055 against the dollar, down from 2.9915 on Friday, and at 1.8355 to the mark, up from 1.8365, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The fixing was an average of 1.99 percent from the average weighted dollar and mark parity rates, softer than Friday's 2.19 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
